<title>JAPAN: Atom - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Atom - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Revenues	     7.77		vs	    6.74</p>
<p> Operating	  173 million	 vs	  273 million</p>
<p> Current	    305 million	 vs	  362 million</p>
<p> Net		  159 million	 vs	  172 million</p>
<p> EPS		   19.73 yen	  vs	   22.92 yen</p>
<p> Shares		 8 million	 vs	    8 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  4.50 yen	  vs	    4.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Atom Corp is an operator of Japanese food restaurants.</p>
